  "description": "SIRMOY crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H100 Ho8 N16 O50,11(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1B (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2B (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1C (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2C (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.593-5.172 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.92-179.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho8(μ3-O)4(L)8(CH3COO)4(CO3)2]·11H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
